# Machine-drafted and not yet reviewed by a native speaker. Every entry here
# was written by translating the source string in isolation, which is exactly
# where that approach is weakest: an English label that reads as a noun on one
# screen and a verb on another gets one guess, and shop vocabulary is full of
# both. Corrections are welcome and are the point.
